  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dsus2]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Dsus2]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dsus2]I don't wanna die\nDon't expext me to die\n[Cmaj7]I've got my enemies with-\nin my sight\n[Bbsus2]We're looking through a stain glass\ngenocide\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dsus2]I don't wanna die\nDon't expext me to die\n[Cmaj7]What's joy without the tears fill-\ning our eyes\n[Bbsus2]Memories of a\nperfect time.\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Dsus2]We dream of nothing, or\nso we say.\n[Cmaj7]We dream of discovering a\nperfect trail,\n[Bbsus2]To the answers that will\nseal our pale faces.\n\n[Verse 4]\n[Dsus2]That can't happen now; it's\nflickering out.\n[Cmaj7]Will we meet again? I\nhope somehow.\n[Bbsus2]Even if we pass you on\nyour way out.\n\n[Interlude]\n[Dsus2]\n[Cmaj7]\n\n[Verse 5]\n[Em]I don't wanna die\nDon't expext me to die.\nWe can live forever.\n[D]\n\n[Verse 6]\n[Em]I don't wanna die\nDon't expext me to die.\nWe can live forever.\n[D]\n\n[Outro]\n[Em]\n[D]\n[Em]\n[D]\n[A7]",
